\par\par \b \uc2 Kenyan bank Stanbic disowns research note on diverging shilling rates\b0\par\par\uc2 498 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 2020\par 09:47\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 NAIROBI, Dec 3 (Reuters) - \uc2 Stanbic Bank\uc2  Kenya, a unit of South Africa's Standard Bank, has distanced itself from a research note issued by its parent that said a parallel exchange rate was emerging in Kenya, where the coranavirus crisis has hit dollar earnings.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's official exchange rate has stayed around 110 shillings to the dollar, but the \uc2 Standard Bank\uc2  note published on Monday said Kenyan banks have shunned interbank deals at that level, offering the dollar at 113-115 shillings.\par \par \uc2 The note said that "two \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates have been developing in the market" since the end of June and early July -- a period when strains caused by the coronavirus crisis, such as a slide in vital tourist dollar revenues, were starting to be felt.\par \par \uc2 The exchange rate has long been a sensitive issue. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has in the past challenged the \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  when it said the shilling was overvalued.\par \par \uc2 When previously asked by reporters about the emergence of different rates, \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Kenya Governor Patrick Njoroge has said \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\uc2  has a flexible rate policy and only \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  to smooth volatility. He most recently repeated this on Friday.\par \par \uc2 "The contents of the report do not reflect the position of Stanbic Bank Kenya Limited," Stanbic said in a statement on Thursday, distancing itself from its parent's note.\par \par \uc2 Bankers say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has told them it believes the shilling is fairly priced and say the bank has been monitoring dealings closely, telling banks that transactions must be driven by demand and not driven by speculation.\par \par \uc2 Njoroge, a former senior \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  official who took charge of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2015, has previously said his focus was "instilling discipline" in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market.\par \par \uc2 The shilling has weakened by 8.5% against the dollar this year, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said last week. But it has fared better than other frontier \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  including the Mauritius rupee, the Nigerian naira and the Zambian kwacha.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Standard Bank\uc2  note said that "due to this divergence in screen and \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  interbank rates, admittedly price discovery has been very cumbersome." It said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not sold dollars in the market in the past month, saying that if it had done so at the official rate it would have helped rates converge.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have declined to comment on the report when contacted by Reuters.\par \par \uc2 The Kenyan unit said the author of the report, Jibran Qureishi, who was previously the East Africa economist at Stanbic, had moved to a new position at the parent bank this year. He was not immediately available for comment.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 IMF\uc2  said in 2018 the shilling was overvalued and cited strict management of the market by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The governor challenged this view at the time, questioning the calculation used by the \uc2 IMF\uc2  to reach that conclusion.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Edmund Blair) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-12-3T09:47:08.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020201203egc3017o9\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
