day and\par  traders said it would be hemmed in a tight range due to\par  expectations of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par              \par  \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 KENYA\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  TREASURIES\par  Yields on Kenyan Treasury bills fell at auction while those\par  of \f28 \uc2 \f2 Treasury\f28 \uc2 \f2  bonds went up. \par                             \par  \par  KENYA OIL\par  Britain's \f28 \uc2 \f2 Tullow Oil\f28 \uc2 \f2  said it struck a promising find of oil\par  in a new region of the country.\par              \par  \par  WEST AFRICA ATTACKS\par  The Pentagon on Wednesday restricted U.S. service members'\par  travel to five West African countries, citing recent\par  militant attacks in the region, U.S. defense officials said.\par              \par  \par  ZIMBABWE IMF LOAN\par  Zimbabwe expects a loan from the \f28 \uc2 \f2 International Monetary\par  Fund\f28 \uc2 \f2 (\f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2 ) in the third quarter of this year, the first since\par  1999, after paying off foreign lenders by the end of June,\par  the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor said on Wednesday.\par              \par  \par  TANZANIA BONDS\par  The yield on Tanzania's two-year \f28 \uc2 \f2 Treasury\f28 \uc2 \f2  bonds rose at\par  auction on Wednesday to 17.51 percent from 17.28 percent at\par  a previous auction in January, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said.\par              \par  \par      For the latest precious metals report click on        \par      For the latest base metals report click on         \par      For the latest crude oil report click on\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-3-17T06:19:34.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160317ec3h00e4l\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoa