ay, supported by expectations from some\par  investors that the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the\par  market. Shares fell.\par              \par  \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 KENYA\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  RATES        \par  \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Kenya\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  kept its benchmark lending rate\par  KECBIR=ECI at 11.5 percent on Wednesday, saying the current\par  stance was adequate to dampen inflation.\par              \par  \par  KENYA DEBT YIELDS\par  Weighted average yields on Kenya's two- and 10-year \f28 \uc2 \f2 Treasury\f28 \uc2 \f2 \par  bonds rose sharply at an auction on Wednesday, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par  bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  said.\par                 \par  \par  ZIMBABWE EXPORTS\par  Zimbabwe's tobacco export earnings rose 11 percent to $855\par  million in 2015 on higher prices and demand from China, an\par  industry official said on Wednesday, but production this\par  year could suffer from a scorching drought.\par              \par  \par  \par  \par      For the latest precious metals report click on        \par      For the latest base metals report click on         \par      For the latest crude oil report click on\f28 \par \par \par \par \uc2 Released: 2016-1-21T06:11:33.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020160121ec1l005k2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
