\par\par \b \uc2 Kenya's shilling holds steady against dollar for now\b0\par\par\uc2 270 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 September 2015\par 11:55\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par NAIROBI, Sept 10 (Reuters) - Kenya's shilling was little\par changed against the dollar on Thursday, but was expected to come\par under pressure once the impact of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par earlier in the week to support the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  fades.\par     At 0925 GMT, commercial banks quoted the shilling at\par 105.25/45, barely changed from Wednesday's close of 105.25/35.\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Kenya\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the market on Monday and\par Tuesday, selling substantial quantities of dollars to boost the\par shilling as the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  edged closer to its record low of\par 106.80, set in October 2011. \par     "It has been stable in that region for the last two days.\par But we expect it to face some pressure from tomorrow to next\par week once the flow dries up," said one trader at a Nairobi-based\par commercial bank.\par     The shilling has come under pressure from a broad rally in\par the dollar, Kenya's large current account deficit and weak\par foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  inflows from tourism after a number of attacks\par by Somalia's \f28 \uc2 \f2 al Shabaab\f28 \uc2 \f2  insurgents.\par     \par                ...........................Shilling spot rates\par                   .....................Shilling forward rates\par                            .......................Cross rates\par          ..