\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Kenya \highlight\uc2 's shilling flat in wake of  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 276 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 September 2015\par 10:08\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par NAIROBI, Sept 9 (Reuters) - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Kenya\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's shilling held steady on\par Wednesday with scarce dollar demand, a day after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  injected dollars into the market to bolster the local\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as it neared its all-time low, traders said.\par     At 0702 GMT, commercial banks quoted the shilling at\par 105.30/50 to the dollar, compared to Tuesday's close of\par 105.35/50.\par     The shilling had been edging closer to its record low of\par 106.80 set in October 2011 before the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  on\par Tuesday at about noon local time as it slipped to 106.55/75\par against the dollar.\par     "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of yesterday seems to have given it the\par support it needed, and so we have seen the shilling on a firmer\par setting this morning," said one Nairobi-based trader.\par     The shilling has come under pressure from a broad rally in\par the dollar, Kenya's high current account deficit and poor\par foreign \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  inflows from tourism after attacks by Somalia's\par \f28 \uc2 \f2 al Shabaab\f28 \uc2 \f2  insurgents.\par     The shilling is down about 16.5 percent against the dollar\par this year.\par        \par                ...........................Shilling spot rates \par                   .....................Shilling forward rates \par                        