\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-Kenyan shilling firms after c.bank  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  near record lows\b0\par\par\uc2 355 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 2015\par 16:01\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2015 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par * Shilling close to its all-time low against dollar\par     * Kenya's main index gains 0.5 pct\par \par  (Adds trader comment, details on c.bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 )\par     NAIROBI, Sept 8 (Reuters) - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Kenya\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's shilling firmed\par against the dollar on Tuesday after the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  sold\par dollars in the market for the second consecutive session,\par boosting the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  as it neared its all-time low.\par     At the close of trade at 1330 GMT, commercial banks quoted\par the shilling at 105.35/50, stronger than Monday's close of\par 106.15/35. \par     The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  at about noon local time (0900\par GMT) after the shilling slipped to 106.55/75 against the dollar,\par almost touching the record low of 106.80 set in October 2011.\par     "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  cooled the market," said one\par Nairobi-based trader. Two other traders confirmed the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , which also sold dollars on Monday, had \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par     Traders say the shilling, down about 16.5 percent against\par the dollar this year, was expected to break through the all-time\par low at some point this week.\par     The Kenyan \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has come under pressure from a broad\par rally in the dollar, Kenya's high current account deficit and\par poor tourism inflows after attacks by Somalia's \f28 \uc2 \f2 al Shabaab\f28 \uc2 \f2 \par insurgents.\par     The NSE20 share index ended 20.10 points higher, or\par 0.5 percent, to close at 4216.83 points.\par     On the secondary market, government bonds valued at 985\par million shillings ($9.35 million)were traded, up from 370\par million shillings traded on Monday.\par     \par                ...........................Shilling spot rates\par                   .....................Shilling forward rates\par                            .......................Cross rates\par          ..................................Local contributors\par            \f28 \uc2 \f2 .......................\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Kenya\f28 \uc2 \f2  Index\par           .....................Kenyan Bonds contributor pages\par                           \f28 \uc2 \f2 ...............Treasury\f28 \uc2 \f2  bill yields\par         ..................\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  open market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 operations\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par         .........................Horizontal repo transactions\par          ,       ................Daily interbank lending rate\par               .............................Kenya Bond pricing\par              ..................Real time Africa economic data\par  <ECI & AFR> ...........................African economic news\par           .................................NSE-20 Share Index\par          .................................NSE All Share Index\par              ...........................FT NSE Kenya 15 Index\par              .......................... FT NSE Kenya 25 Index\par   SPEED GUIDES:\par                                     \par             \par  \par \par ($1 = 105.3500 Kenyan shillings)\par \par  (Reporting by Aaron Maasho, Drazen Jorgic; Editing by Keith\par Weir)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Released: 2015-9-8T15:01:22.000Z   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020150908eb9800f2w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
