a cut of the deal that saw Cove sold.                \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 KENYA SECURITY\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A bomb tore through a minibus in Nairobi's Somali-dominated Eastleigh\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 neighbourhood on Sunday, killing six people in an attack highlighting the\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 security risks \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Kenya\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  faces because of its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in Somalia to fight al\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Qaeda-linked militants.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 UGANDA CORRUPTION\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Britain has suspended all aid to the government of Uganda over new evidence\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 that British taxpayers' money may have been stolen, Development Secretary\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Justine Greening said on Friday.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 TANZANIA-MALAWI/EXPLORATION\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Tanzania and Malawi agreed on Saturday to appoint an international mediator to\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 resolve a long-running border dispute over Lake Malawi, thought to sit over\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 rich oil and gas reserves.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 DRCONGO WAR\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Rebels in Congo, who U.N. experts say are backed by neighbouring Rwanda,\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 reached the outskirts of the eastern city of Goma on Sunday after pushing back\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.N. peacekeepers and government troops, but a rebel spokesman said they did\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par not plan to take the city.                \par \par   For the latest precious metals report click on        \par   For the latest base metals report click on         \par   For the latest crude oil report click on       \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 AFRICA-FACTORS/ (CORRECTED) | AFN | ABN | D | C | GRO | MTL | SOF | RBN | M | E | RNP | DNP | PTD   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020121120e8bk00033\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580