\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 1-C.bank: \highlight22\uc2 Kenya \highlight\uc2  shilling  \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  would worsen matters\b0\par\par\uc2 483 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 2011\par 10:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2  * Says euro zone fears boosting dollar\par \par \uc2  * Sees no direct remedy to shilling's fall\par \par \uc2  * Rejects claims that CBK does not care about rate\par \par \uc2 (Adds governor's quotes, details)\par \par \uc2  By Duncan Miriri\par \par \uc2  NAIROBI, June 20 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market at this stage to prop up \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\uc2 's shilling <KES=> would make things worse for the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as some of its problems stem from concerns about the euro zone, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said.\par \par \uc2  The shilling was quoted by commercial banks at 90.10/30 against the dollar at 0903 GMT, following his remarks, weaker than Friday's closing level of 89.70/80.\par \par \uc2  The Kenyan \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has lost more than 10 percent against the dollar this year on the back of high inflation, prompting concerns the weakening could give rise to a spiral in inflation through higher import costs.\par \par \uc2  It fell to record lows against the greenback last week, touching 90.85 on Thursday.\par \par \uc2  Kenya's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sought to boost its foreign reserves in recent months by buying hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, while also tightening shilling liquidity via repurchase agreements.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Kenya\uc2  (CBK) governor Njuguna Ndung'u said the debt and deficit crisis in the euro zone had worked to the dollar's advantage, with its appeal as a reserve \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  benefiting from concerns about the euro.\par \par \uc2  "This is bidding its price up and weakening the shilling and other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . So there is no direct remedy until we wait for the euro fears to subside, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will worsen the situation at this stage," he said in a statement to Reuters.\par \par \uc2  "This has put pressure on the shilling to depreciate on one hand and creates inflationary pressure on the other hand."\par \par \uc2  The pressure on domestic prices is coming from pass-through effects, especially from fuel and commodity prices, which were exacerbated by uncertainties in the market and pressure from a weaker shilling, he said.\par \par \uc2  Year-on-year inflation rose to 12.95 percent in May from 12.05 percent in the previous month. [ID:nLDE74U07O]\par \par \uc2  Ndung'u rejected claims by some analysts and traders that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does not care about the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  movements and that if it did, it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . [ID:nLDE7580LQ]\par \par \uc2  "The CBK is monitoring the situation very closely from the domestic market to international developments," he said.\par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Monetary Policy Committee adopted a tightening stance in March, reversing a 25 basis point cut made in January. It then raised its rate by a further quarter point last month to 6.25 percent, and increased the amount of cash that banks are required to hold. [ID:nLDE74U1TR] \par \par \uc2  It expects the tightening policy to fight inflation and stabilise the exchange rate, Ndung'u said last week.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by James Macharia and Catherine Evans)   \par \par \uc2 KENYA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /GOVERNOR (UPDATE 1)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110623e76k000hl\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
