\par\par \b \uc2 Kenya shilling falls vs dlr on importer appetite\b0\par\par\uc2 298 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 Oktober 2008\par 11:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 NAIROBI, Oct 21 (Reuters) - Kenya's shilling <KES=> eased against the dollar on Tuesday as importers, perceiving the exchange rate as favourable, flooded the market for the U.S \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 At 0915 GMT, commercial banks posted the unit at 77.25/35 against the dollar compared to Friday's close of 76.00/20.\par \par \uc2 "There is excitement in terms of cheaper rates across the board. Many people are just seeing these as good, cheap prices and they have bought for their requirements," said \uc2 Kenya Commercial Bank\uc2 's Robert Aloo.\par \par \uc2 The shilling depreciated to 79.00/10 on Friday before the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Kenya\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  through a dollar sale, helping the unit pare some of its losses.\par \par \uc2 Aloo said there was no indication the shilling's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 -backed rally would be sustained in the days ahead.\par \par \uc2 Bank of Africa\uc2 's Kennedy Butiko said the market is watching for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's next move.\par \par \uc2 "We want to see whether the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will come in because that is what will actually hold the shilling. Demand (for dollars) is there," he said.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Njuguna Ndung'u said in a statement late on Friday that there were no significant signs of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  supply constraints now or in the future.\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  <KES=> <KES1=>............Shilling spot rates\par  <KESF=>...............Shilling forward rates       \par  <EURKES=>    <KESX=>.Cross rates\par  <KE/CONT1=>............All Kenya Contributors\par  <CBKINDEX>\f28 \uc2 \f2 ........\f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  of Kenya\f28 \uc2 \f2  Index\par  <KE/DEBT>......Kenyan Bonds contributor pages       \par  <CBK03>    <CBK06> <KE3MTB=>.    Treasury bill yields\par  <KEIBR=>,<CBK02>    Daily interbank lending rate\par  <0#KETSY=>    Kenya Bond pricing    \par  SPEED GUIDES:                         \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 <REUTERS> <KES/1> <KE/DEBT> <MONEY> (Reporting by Duncan Miriri; Editing by Victoria Main)\f28 \par \par \uc2 KENYA-\b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCY\b0 \highlight\uc2 /|LANGEN|Table|ABN|M|E|RBN|D|AFN|RNP|DNP|PTD|PMF   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020081024e4al00134\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
